# cf-mirror-export digests
#
# Recomputed and compared by adapters/hubspot/check-cf-mirror-export.mjs on every
# `npm run sweeps`. A digest nobody recomputes is a pin in name only ([R-37]).
#
# A BATCH digest covers the text strictly BETWEEN its BEGIN and END delimiter lines,
# exclusive, joined with newlines — so a batch can be handed to B2 on its own and
# checked on its own.
#
# The .md and .csv digests are here in addition to the JSON one the specification
# requires. They cost nothing and they pin the two files a reader is most likely to
# open and edit by hand.

